OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA fine
OL,6,Fevening with some late sunshine. Skies
OL,7,Fwill cloud over after dark though,
OL,8,Fwith some showery outbreaks of rain
OL,9,Farriving overnight. A mild night,
OL,10,Fthough becoming rather breezy in the
OL,11,Fwest with a strengthening southerly
OL,12,Fwind.
OL,13,
OL,14,CSunday:FOutbreaks of showery clearing
OL,15,Fby mid morning. Becoming dry and
OL,16,Frather warm with some bright or sunny
OL,17,Fspells developing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
